    "detailed_description": "<h1>\ud83d\udc9fAdd in WishList!!\ud83d\udc9f</h1><p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1>\ud83d\udc97Taiwan Love Story \u2075\ud83d\udc97<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2976870/extras/0cdd6ed7008b84b39ec47e78ee78bf13.poster.avif?t=1751546046\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2976870/extras/0cdd6ed7008b84b39ec47e78ee78bf13.webm?t=1751546046\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2976870/extras/0cdd6ed7008b84b39ec47e78ee78bf13.mp4?t=1751546046\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Story</h2>You're a college senior studying humanities at a university, and during a camping event held by your department, you meet five women from different parts of Taiwan. While you're hanging around the bonfire, a mysterious kiss leaves you lovestruck and yearning for more. Inspiration strikes, and you finally settle on a thesis topic: &quot;The Binary Equation of Love and Happiness.&quot;<br><br>In order to both finish your thesis and find true love, you set out on an adventure around the island. Along the way, you meet up with the women and experience a series of bittersweet romantic encounters bursting with youthful naivety. Your very own Taiwanese love story is about to begin...<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2976870/extras/164d835046df99da0eb30814c3d34cc1.poster.avif?t=1751546046\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2976870/extras/164d835046df99da0eb30814c3d34cc1.webm?t=1751546046\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2976870/extras/164d835046df99da0eb30814c3d34cc1.mp4?t=1751546046\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2976870/extras/c41dc2bf74efeae08d36f6500153b7a1.poster.avif?t=1751546046\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2976870/extras/c41dc2bf74efeae08d36f6500153b7a1.webm?t=1751546046\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2976870/extras/c41dc2bf74efeae08d36f6500153b7a1.mp4?t=1751546046\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2976870/extras/bc782fe7bafd215ce053eeefea6fb9c2.poster.avif?t=1751546046\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2976870/extras/bc782fe7bafd215ce053eeefea6fb9c2.webm?t=1751546046\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2976870/extras/bc782fe7bafd215ce053eeefea6fb9c2.mp4?t=1751546046\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Light, fun simulation gameplay<br></li><li>Well-crafted, rich storylines for all 5 women<br></li><li>Exciting mini-games that match the game's theme<br></li><li>Full voice acting for the women!<br></li><li>Deep insights into local Taiwanese life and culture<br></li><li>Fully dynamic, immersive CGs<br></li><li>Download the free DLCs to unlock even more content!</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2976870/extras/5351097092d1aa4bcf1bceabaad50c0d.poster.avif?t=1751546046\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2976870/extras/5351097092d1aa4bcf1bceabaad50c0d.webm?t=1751546046\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2976870/extras/5351097092d1aa4bcf1bceabaad50c0d.mp4?t=1751546046\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Characters</h2><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2976870/extras/c9207a8bd17a43424334263235f1d6fb.poster.avif?t=1751546046\" width=616 height=308 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2976870/extras/c9207a8bd17a43424334263235f1d6fb.webm?t=1751546046\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2976870/extras/c9207a8bd17a43424334263235f1d6fb.mp4?t=1751546046\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Amy Lin<br>A female professional who's traveled to the big city for work. She's an absent-minded and somewhat clumsy white-collar employee. Though she appears innocent and sweet, deep down she has a rather stubborn side.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2976870/extras/cb00025e21b9262ec17f5c47b42182b7.poster.avif?t=1751546046\" width=616 height=308 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2976870/extras/cb00025e21b9262ec17f5c47b42182b7.webm?t=1751546046\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2976870/extras/cb00025e21b9262ec17f5c47b42182b7.mp4?t=1751546046\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Amanda Zhang<br>An aristocratic bookworm from Kaohsiung who's quiet and reserved, having been brought up in a strict household. She loves singing, but her father's plan has no room for art, so she has to give up on her dream...<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2976870/extras/f6ed56e42ab056920e85b42a03bf03b1.poster.avif?t=1751546046\" width=616 height=308 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2976870/extras/f6ed56e42ab056920e85b42a03bf03b1.webm?t=1751546046\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2976870/extras/f6ed56e42ab056920e85b42a03bf03b1.mp4?t=1751546046\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Zoe Hai<br>A lively, exuberant girl from Penghu. She loves diving and seems to have endless energy. Ain't nobody don't love Zoe!<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2976870/extras/515548e4aee622a96d99c13f2bca64cf.poster.avif?t=1751546046\" width=616 height=308 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2976870/extras/515548e4aee622a96d99c13f2bca64cf.webm?t=1751546046\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2976870/extras/515548e4aee622a96d99c13f2bca64cf.mp4?t=1751546046\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Lil' Blu<br>A hot betel nut babe from Taichung who acts like she won't let anyone get close. She's got a strong personality and is tough as shit, but deep down, she's just a girl who longs for affection.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2976870/extras/81d6b7c638c95e3265a